    "source": "UploadFile.linkProps and UploadList/ListItem filename anchor",
    "observation": "19 raw cases cover defaults, object/JSON attributes and styles across all list types, class replacement, filenames without URL, and click ordering/cancellation. File URL wins over linkProps.href. Only filename anchor receives linkProps; thumbnail/preview action retain their defaults. Five live transitions retain the filename anchor. Svelte maps className/onClick/style object to native class/onclick/style string."
  },
